{"id":"trata","lemma":"trata","pos":"noun","rank":351,"glosses":["trafficking, trade, slave trade"],"ipa":"/ˈtɾata/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"tratas"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/3/30/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Precision27-trata.wav","examples":[{"text":"¿De qué se trata?","en":"What's it about?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/442223"},{"text":"¿Qué tratas de hacer?","en":"What are you trying to do?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/519463"},{"text":"Trata una vez más.","en":"Try it once more.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/444398"},{"text":"Me gusta la manera en que me tratas.","en":"I like the way you treat me.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/581967"},{"text":"Trata de llevarte bien.","en":"Try to get along.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/722110"}]}